== test_settled_hold_mirror_over_done_lane_never_wedge_escalates
ok - a settled hold mirror over a done lane surfaces one terminal stale, then stays inert and never wedge-escalates
exit=0
== test_settled_hold_mirror_over_paused_lane_resurfaces_once_per_cadence
ok - a settled hold mirror over a paused lane resurfaces once per cadence, never once per relaunch
exit=0
== test_hold_mirror_transition_keeps_the_stale_throttle
ok - a hold and its release recorded by firstmate keep the stale throttle and suppressor they found
exit=0
== test_settled_transfer_keeps_the_stale_suppressor
ok - an answered complete transfer reads back to its decision and leaves the surfaced lane inert
exit=0
